# Compiled Stan models produce extensionless executables next to their .stan
# source. Ignore any file without an extension everywhere; re-include anything
# with a dot (source files like .stan, .qmd, .py, .R, .bib, .css, data files)
# and all directories. This auto-ignores compiled binaries in every case-study
# folder without per-folder rules.
*
!*.*
!*/


/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
_book/

# Quarto / Stan generated outputs
/_freeze/

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
